# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout — Windows
# included. The wheel force-includes repo-root `.cataforge/` verbatim from the
# working tree (see pyproject `[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel.force-include]`),
# so a CRLF checkout would pack CRLF scaffold and make every downstream
# `cataforge upgrade apply` report false drift against its LF files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types: never apply line-ending conversion (also auto-detected by
# `text=auto`, listed for intent).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
# RocksDB store artefacts (KG): under kg-first a downstream project commits
# these as the source of truth — they must round-trip byte-for-byte.
*.sst  binary
*.ldb  binary
